:"yny_37a_8rg","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"母憂去職","song052_wangdan_reading":"mother"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-wangdan-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004","quote":"除員外散騎常侍，未拜，高祖請為太尉諮議參軍，轉長史。盡心歸奉，日夜不懈，高祖甚委仗之。北伐廣固，領齊郡太守。盧循自蔡洲南走，劉毅固求追討，高祖持疑未決，誕密白曰：「公既平廣固，復滅盧循，則功蓋終古，勳無與二，如此大威，豈可餘人分之。毅與公同起布衣，一時相推耳，今既已喪敗，不宜復使立功。」高祖從其說。七年，以誕為吳國內史。母憂去職。高祖征劉毅，起為輔國將軍，誕固辭軍號，墨絰從行。時諸葛長民行太尉留府事，心不自安，高祖甚慮之。毅既平，誕求先下，高祖曰：「長民似有自疑心，卿詎宜便去。」誕曰：「長民知我蒙公垂眄，今輕身單下，必當以為無虞，乃可以少安其意。」高祖笑曰：「卿勇過賁、育矣。」於是先還。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004:m0154","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004:m0161"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"誕之母卒，未給名氏或生母稱。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-nan023-digital-mother","person_id":"yny_37a_8rg","event_type":"death","source_term":"母憂","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan:p002","surface":"母憂","start":116,"end":118},"date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan:p002","quote":"誕為宋武帝太尉長史，盡心歸奉，帝甚仗之。盧循自蔡洲南走，劉毅固求追討。誕密白帝曰：「公既平廣固，復滅盧循，則功蓋終古，勳無與二。如此大威，豈可使餘人分之？毅與公同起布衣，一時相推耳，今既喪敗，不宜復使立功。」帝納其說。後為吳國內史，母憂去職。","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan:p002:m0116"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"誕任吳國內史後。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"le-nan023-print-mother","person_id":"yny_37a_8rg","event_type":"death","source_term":"母憂","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p002","surface":"母憂","start":96,"end"