05c4","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-ws2478204"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004","text":"除員外散騎常侍，未拜，高祖請為太尉諮議參軍，轉長史。盡心歸奉，日夜不懈，高祖甚委仗之。北伐廣固，領齊郡太守。盧循自蔡洲南走，劉毅固求追討，高祖持疑未決，誕密白曰：「公既平廣固，復滅盧循，則功蓋終古，勳無與二，如此大威，豈可餘人分之。毅與公同起布衣，一時相推耳，今既已喪敗，不宜復使立功。」高祖從其說。七年，以誕為吳國內史。母憂去職。高祖征劉毅，起為輔國將軍，誕固辭軍號，墨絰從行。時諸葛長民行太尉留府事，心不自安，高祖甚慮之。毅既平，誕求先下，高祖曰：「長民似有自疑心，卿詎宜便去。」誕曰：「長民知我蒙公垂眄，今輕身單下，必當以為無虞，乃可以少安其意。」高祖笑曰：「卿勇過賁、育矣。」於是先還。","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004:m0054","surface":"盧循","start":54,"end":56,"person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA**A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004:m0062","surface":"劉毅","start":62,"end":64,"person_id":"a59_2c3_a2e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004:m0076","surface":"誕","start":76,"end":77,"person_id":"vhf_729_g6z","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004:m0090","surface":"盧循","start":90,"end":92,"person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA**A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004:m0116","surface":"毅","start":116,"end":117,"person_id":"a59_2c3_a2e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004:m0154","surface":"誕","start":154,"end":155,"person_id":"vhf_729_g6z","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004:m0161","surface":"母","start":161,"end":162,"person_id":"yny_37a_8rg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-wangdan:p004:m0169","surface":"劉毅","start":169,"end":171,"person_id":"a59_2c3_a2e","kind":"person","status":"contex